  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>f</mi></math> be a differentiable function from <math><mi>R</mi></math> to <math><mi>R</mi></math> such that <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math> for all <math><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mtext>.</mtext><mtext>&#160;</mtext></math> If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> then <math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
